  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A grateful sky dragon has rewarded you with a shred of its power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Any good alignment, you must have performed a service for a mythic sky dragon.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Fly is a class skill for you, and the DC for you to move against strong winds, whether on land or flying, is reduced by 5.</p>\n<p><strong>Mythic:</strong> Fly is a class skill for you, and you are unaffected by strong winds when flying. You can expend one use of mythic power to fly as the spell, as if the caster level were twice your mythic tier. If you expend two uses of mythic power, you gain overland flight instead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
